    "description": {
      "content": "Amazon Relational Database Service (RDS) makes it easy to set up, operate, and scale a relational database in the cloud. This API enables you to create and manage database instances, clusters, snapshots, and other database resources with support for multiple database engines including MySQL, PostgreSQL, MariaDB, Oracle, SQL Server, and Amazon Aurora.\n\nContact Support:\n Name: Amazon Web Services",
